---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { href } from '../../lib/href';
import Widget from '../../components/DecouplingDerivation.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Deriving the Decoupling Matrix — ECE/ME 732">
  <p class="crumb"><a href={href("/interactives/")}>← Interactives</a></p>
  <h1>Deriving the Decoupling Matrix</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Two actuators, two things you want from them, and a matrix in the controller
    that sorts out which actuator does how much. This page builds that matrix
    from nothing, one step at a time: where each entry comes from, how the
    matrix is turned around, and how it ends up as blocks and summing junctions.
  </p>
  <p class="hint">
    Five steps. Each one has something to move or fill in, and the numbers in
    every step follow the same sliders. An entry with a dotted underline lights
    up wherever else it appears when you hover it.
  </p>
  <Widget />
</BaseLayout>
